00:24:07,090 --> 00:24:09,280
没有一处表明他是恐怖分子
that suggests he's a terrorist.

370
00:24:09,560 --> 00:24:11,480
他们刚刚在那家汽车旅馆搜出了
They just found enough C-4

371
00:24:11,500 --> 00:24:14,180
能夷平整个街区的C4炸药
in that motel room to level a city block.

372
00:24:14,180 --> 00:24:15,600
你觉得是什么情况
What do you think it looks like?

373
00:24:16,460 --> 00:24:19,720
政府不抓到他是不会罢休的
The government is not going to rest until they've got him.

374
00:24:20,110 --> 00:24:22,940
我不想看你冒着枪林弹雨
I just... I don't wanna see you caught in the cross fire.

375
00:24:24,390 --> 00:24:27,490
是为了保护我还是保护你自己
Is this about protecting me or protecting you?

376
00:24:29,310 --> 00:24:33,340
放一天假  喝一杯或多喝几杯  这是你应得的
Take the day off. Have a drink or five. You've earned it.

377
00:24:34,150 --> 00:24:37,000
要不是因为你  他们找不到那些炸药
They wouldn't have found those explosives if it weren't for you.

378
00:24:37,000 --> 00:24:38,720
你今天救了好多人的命
You actually saved lives today.

379
00:24:39,640 --> 00:24:43,410
省省吧  霍加斯  别担心我
Well, save yourself some time, Hogarth. Stop worrying about me.

380
00:24:51,180 --> 00:24:54,110
{\an8}鸡尾酒酒吧

381
00:25:13,720 --> 00:25:15,950
这只是看起来像塑料
This only looks like plastic,

382
00:25:15,950 --> 00:25:18,280
但它是纯金的
but I'm telling you it's solid gold.

383
00:25:18,430 --> 00:25:20,420
地震让所有人都疯了
Earthquake has everyone going crazy.

384
00:25:20,420 --> 00:25:22,710
没人会注意到小东西
Nobody's paying attention to the little things,

385
00:25:22,710 --> 00:25:26,730
比如钱包里缺了什么东西
like what is or isn't in their wallets.

386
00:25:31,020 --> 00:25:33,700
-欢迎回来  大块头  -我们得谈谈
- Welcome back, big man. - We need to talk.

387
00:25:38,090 --> 00:25:41,020
-你就这么谈  -我要答案  特科
- This is how you talk? - I want answers, Turk.

388
00:25:41,050 --> 00:25:42,410
至于怎么得到就看你了
How I get 'em is up to you.

389
00:25:42,410 --> 00:25:46,290
凯奇  这破事哪里跟我有关了
Cage, what part of this shit looks like it's up to me?

390
00:25:46,300 --> 00:25:49,650
玛莉娅和沙兹  我需要知道他们想干什么
Mariah and Shades... I need to know what they're up to.

391
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:51,990
据我所知  什么也不想
Far as I know, nothing.

392
00:25:51,990 --> 00:25:54,150
你走之后他们也不见了
They ghosted right after you left.

393
00:25:54,150 --> 00:25:57,160
就算他们在做什么  也是我不知道的事
If they got their hands in anything, it ain't stuff I've seen.

394
00:25:57,220 --> 00:25:59,650
那是谁在招募哈莱姆区的孩子  害他们被杀
Then who's recruiting kids out of Harlem and getting them killed?

395
00:26:00,190 --> 00:26:03,110
孩子  哥们  我看起来像家长教师会的吗
Kids? Man, do I look like the PTA?

396
00:26:04,440 --> 00:26:07,100
深夜出动  报酬高  结局惨
Late-night work. Pays well, ends bad.

397
00:26:07,250 --> 00:26:09,060
没人知道他们在干什么
No one seems to know what they're doing.

398
00:26:09,060 --> 00:26:11,920
我想帮忙  但我什么也不知道
Look, I'd love to help, but I don't know shit.

399
00:26:12,590 --> 00:26:13,880
我觉得你知道
I think you do.

400
00:26:17,650 --> 00:26:19,720
好吧  我是听说过
Okay! I heard about it!

401
00:26:19,720 --> 00:26:21,800
但没人来问我  明白吗
But ain't nobody come asking me, okay?

402
00:26:21,800 --> 00:26:23,520
我是个老派的人  不掺和这种事
I'm too old-school for this anyway.

403
00:26:23,520 --> 00:26:25,860
他们在干什么  谁让他们做的
What are they doing? And who are they doing it for?

404
00:26:26,050 --> 00:26:28,510
有个新来的  他很显眼
Some new guy. Can't miss him.

405
00:26:29,130 --> 00:26:30,130
我不知道他叫什么
I don't know his name.

406
00:26:30,130 --> 00:26:31,300
大家都叫他白帽子
Everyone just calls him White Hat

407
00:26:31,300 --> 00:26:33,210
因为他对时尚见解独特
on account of his unique fashion sense.

408
00:26:33,580 --> 00:26:35,600
也是百分之百的黑人
Real deal African brother, too, man.

409
00:26:35,600 --> 00:26:40,190
白色西服  巴拿马帽  鳄鱼皮鞋
White suit, Panama hat, alligator shoes.

410
00:26:41,380 --> 00:26:45,290
-我去哪找他  -我只见过他几次
- Where can I find him? - I've only seen him a couple times.

411
00:26:45,290 --> 00:26:48,100
试试去151街和阿姆斯特丹
Try around 151st and Amsterdam.

412
00:26:49,380 --> 00:26:51,980
要是你没说实话  我会回来的
If this isn't the truth, I'll be back.

413
00:26:52,490 --> 00:26:53,840
那时候你可不会太喜欢我
And you won't like me then.

414
00:26:56,090 --> 00:26:57,460
我现在就不喜欢你
I don't like you now.

415
00:27:21,850 --> 00:27:23,000
有人吗
Hello?

416
00:27:30,290 --> 00:27:31,930
我竟然想住在这
Is it weird that I wanna live here?

417
00:27:40,830 --> 00:27:41,940
丹尼
Danny.

418
00:27:42,590 --> 00:27:44,850
丹尼  这就是冢本刀
Danny, this is a Tsukamoto.

419
00:27:50,500 --> 00:27:52,120
就像你给我看过的那把
Just like the one you showed me.

420
00:27:53,140 --> 00:27:54,220
是啊
Yeah.

421
00:27:56,070 --> 00:27:57,780
但一般不会开刃
But you don't sharpen these.

422
00:28:03,810 --> 00:28:05,890
除非你想用它们
Unless you plan on using them.

423
00:28:07,180 --> 00:28:08,240
丹尼
Danny...

424
00:28:54,160 --> 00:28:55,370
天啊
Oh, my God.

425
00:28:57,160 --> 00:28:58,400
他没死多久
It hasn't been long.

426
00:29:00,290 --> 00:29:01,500
还有体温
He's still warm.

427
00:29:07,620 --> 00:29:09,190
有人被拖走了
Someone was dragged out of here.

428
00:29:12,470 --> 00:29:13,970
肯定是手和会干的
This must have been the Hand.

429
00:29:20,260 --> 00:29:21,700
那这些是什么人
Then who are these people?

430
00:29:24,760 --> 00:29:25,960
我不知道
I don't know.

431
00:29:51,510 --> 00:29:52,640
丹尼
Danny?

432
00:30:00,030 --> 00:30:01,120
怎么了
What is it?

433
00:30:02,770 --> 00:30:03,910
是昆仑
It's K'un-Lun.

434
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,920
米丝蒂  我是卢克
Misty, it's Luke.

435
00:30:53,920 --> 00:30:55,240
我有所发现
I think I found something.

436
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:57,160
你应该弄张逮捕令  过来找我
You should get a warrant and get down here.

437
00:30:57,170 --> 00:31:01,640
-我要逮捕谁吗  -应该吧  涉及到孩子
- Am I making arrests? - Think so. It's about those kids.

438
00:31:02,780 --> 00:31:04,240
我也许找到线索了
I may have found a lead.

439
00:31:07,760 --> 00:31:10,770
卢克  你在哪  给我个地址
Luke? Where are you? I need an address.

440
00:31:11,930 --> 00:31:13,920
-算了  -什么
- Never mind. - What?

441
00:31:13,920 --> 00:31:17,410
-我得先解决掉一个人  -不行  卢克
- I gotta take care of someone first. - No. Luke--

442
00:31:31,930 --> 00:31:35,430
把预约推后十分钟  富兰克林  我要说句话
Push my calls ten minutes. Franklin, I need a word.

443
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:37,100
待会见
See you later.

444
00:31:37,720 --> 00:31:40,660
你还有多少案子  我要你盯着点东西
How's your case load? I need you to keep an eye on something.

445
00:31:41,170 --> 00:31:43,490
-很乐意  -但要私下进行
- Happy to. - But it's gotta be off the record.

446
00:31:43,720 --> 00:31:44,750
好
Okay.

447
00:31:44,750 --> 00:31:47,680
之前有个在这工作的自由职业者
Someone who used to work here, a freelancer...

448
00:31:47,680 --> 00:31:50,080
她可能会失控  她叫杰西卡·琼斯
She has a tendency to go rogue. Her name is Jessica Jones.

449
00:31:50,080 --> 00:31:52,880
你我这次谈话从来没发生过
Now you and I never had this conversation,

450
00:31:53,390 --> 00:31:56,610
但只要她一陷入麻烦
but the second she gets herself into trouble,

451
00:31:56,610 --> 00:32:00,270
当务之急就是让我们离麻烦越远越好
priority one is keeping that trouble very far away from us.

452
00:32:00,320 --> 00:32:01,440
好
Okay.

453
00:32:02,310 --> 00:32:05,750
抱歉  让我把话说明白
So... Sorry, uh, just to be clear...

454
00:32:06,760 --> 00:32:09,150
这只是以防万一吧  她现在没什么麻烦吧
this is all just in case? She's not in trouble now?

455
00:32:09,430 --> 00:32:12,300
我倒想  事关杰西卡  只是时间问题
I wish. With Jessica, it's just a matter of time.

456
00:32:24,490 --> 00:32:25,900
杰西  你去哪了
Jess, where have you been?

457
00:32:25,900 --> 00:32:27,790
-抱歉  我今天太累了  -我也是
- Sorry, I had a long day. - Me, too.

458
00:32:27,790 --> 00:32:29,980
演播室有些事情不太对劲
Something weird's going on at the studio.

459
00:32:30,100 --> 00:32:31,240
怎么个奇怪法
Weird how?

460
00:32:31,550 --> 00:32:33,120
地震的事  我觉得
This tremor stuff, I think...

461
00:32:33,120 --> 00:32:35,280
他们想让我掩盖这件事
I think they want me to sweep it under the rug.

462
00:32:37,470 --> 00:32:38,860
崔西  我再打给你
Trish, I gotta call you back.

463
00:32:56,060 --> 00:32:59,390
马尔科姆  你要来我家的话  我怎么跟你说的
Malcolm, what did I tell you about coming in my apartment?

464
00:32:59,980 --> 00:33:01,940
我告诉你别再跟着我了
I told you to stop following me.

465
00:33:12,340 --> 00:33:13,640
这说不通
It doesn't make sense.

466
00:33:16,170 --> 00:33:18,480
为什么这些人有昆仑的图片
Why do these people have a picture of K'un-Lun?

467
00:33:20,210 --> 00:33:21,760
他们还知道什么
And what else did they know?

468
00:33:25,820 --> 00:33:27,040
有人来了
Someone's coming.

469
00:33:33,840 --> 00:33:35,100
你们从那边开始
You guys start over there.

470
00:33:58,570 --> 00:33:59,630
他们想干什么
What are they doing?

471
00:34:01,100 --> 00:34:02,270
我不知道
I don't know.

472
00:34:03,270 --> 00:34:05,350
但他们别想逃脱
But they're not gonna get away with this.

473
00:34:12,110 --> 00:34:13,540
你妻子来找过我
Your wife came to me.

474
00:34:14,980 --> 00:34:16,310
她很担心
She was worried.

475
00:34:16,660 --> 00:34:20,400
-我告诉过你别管  -雷蒙德先生  相信我
- I told you to stay away. - Mr. Raymond, trust me.

476
00:34:20,730 --> 00:34:22,370
现在我真的后悔没听你的话
Right now, I wish I'd listened.

477
00:34:22,690 --> 00:34:23,940
你在跟他们合作吗
Are you working with them?

478
00:34:25,580 --> 00:34:26,630
跟谁
With who?

479
00:34:27,490 --> 00:34:28,960
你知道我说的是谁
You know who I'm talking about.

480
00:34:29,910 --> 00:34:31,150
我单干
I work alone.

481
00:34:31,470 --> 00:34:32,860
一直都是
Always has.

482
00:34:33,180 --> 00:34:35,870
我说过  几乎没人雇我
Look, like I said, I'm barely on the payroll.

483
00:34:35,870 --> 00:34:37,750
好吧  不管你怎么想
Okay, whatever you think is going on...

484
00:34:39,640 --> 00:34:42,310
不管你觉得现在什么状况
whatever you think is happening here--

485
00:34:42,310 --> 00:34:45,470
这里的状况我一清二楚  我知道得太多了
I know damn well what is happening here. I know too much.

486
00:34:46,320 --> 00:34:48,230
接下来  他们就要杀我的家人
And next, they'll come after my family.

487
00:34:48,230 --> 00:34:51,840
他们是谁  谁要杀你
Who's they? Who do you think is after you?

488
00:34:51,970 --> 00:34:53,760
我不能告诉你  我
I can't tell you. I...

489
00:34:54,410 --> 00:34:57,050
我不想这么干  我是个好人
This... this is not me. I'm a good man.

490
00:34:57,660 --> 00:34:59,020
你一定要告诉她
Make sure you tell her that.

491
00:34:59,130 --> 00:35:01,580
好吧  但愿你能亲自告诉她
Okay, with any luck, you're gonna tell her that yourself.

492
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:03,010
你家人很担心
Now your family is worried.

493
00:35:03,010 --> 00:35:04,850
他们想知道发生了什么
They just wanted to know what happened.

494
00:35:04,860 --> 00:35:06,130
还有警察
And the cops...

495
00:35:06,580 --> 00:35:10,080
他们想知道你为什么囤积炸药
They just wanna know why you started stockpiling explosives.

496
00:35:10,100 --> 00:35:11,160
什么
What?

497
00:35:11,700 --> 00:35:12,980
我无处可去了
There's nowhere to go.

498
00:35:13,560 --> 00:35:15,620
他们会找到我的  他们会伤害我的
They'll find me. They'll... they'll hurt me.

499
00:35:15,620 --> 00:35:18,770
说实话  如果你伤害我的朋友  我就加倍奉还
To be honest, if you hurt my friend, I'm gonna hurt you worse.

500
00:35:20,120 --> 00:35:21,940
我只是想阻止他们
I was just trying to stop them.

501
00:35:22,060 --> 00:35:24,960
-他们会炸掉整座城市的  -谁
- They're gonna take down the city. - Who?

502
00:35:26,640 --> 00:35:28,970
你要是不告诉我他们是谁  我就没法帮你
I can't help you if you won't tell me who.

503
00:35:30,420 --> 00:35:31,970
我就不该到这来
I should never have come here.

504
00:35:35,220 --> 00:35:37,570
天啊  太迟了
Oh, my God. It's too late.

505
00:35:49,550 --> 00:35:50,900
你别想得到
You can't have this.

506
00:36:02,130 --> 00:36:03,180
你没事吧
You okay?

507
00:36:44,350 --> 00:36:45,800
站在那别动
Hold it right there.

508
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:50,450
-糟了  -转过来
- Shit. - Turn around.

509
00:36:52,810 --> 00:36:54,360
手举起来
Get your hands up!

510
00:36:55,190 --> 00:36:56,290
快
Now!

511
00:37:10,280 --> 00:37:11,930
好啊  混蛋们
Hey there, assholes.

512
00:37:30,790 --> 00:37:32,300
-你们跟手和会是一伙的  -不
- You with the Hand? - No!

513
00:37:36,030 --> 00:37:38,540
-你在那干什么  -不知道  我只是个清洁工
- What are you doing in there? - I don't know! I'm just a cleanup!

514
00:37:38,540 --> 00:37:40,660
-为他们收拾烂摊子  -我不知道他们是谁
- Cleanup for them? - I don't know who they are!

515
00:37:40,660 --> 00:37:42,340
别撒谎
Don't lie to me!

516
00:37:47,470 --> 00:37:49,390
-你是谁  -你是谁
- Who are you? - Who are you?

517
00:37:52,930 --> 00:37:54,980
-你没事吧  -你在干什么
- You all right? - What are you doing?

518
00:37:54,980 --> 00:37:56,150
聊着天呢
In between gigs, huh?

519
00:38:02,260 --> 00:38:04,000
-你还想找打吗  -不
- You back for more? - No.

520
00:38:04,780 --> 00:38:06,560
我们还没动真格呢
We've not even started.

521
00:38:29,400 --> 00:38:30,820
你是什么材料做的
What are you made of?

522
00:38:31,170 --> 00:38:33,610
记住  是你先挑事的
Just remember, you started this.

523
00:38:46,260 --> 00:38:47,420
趴下
Stay down.

524
00:39:38,710 --> 00:39:39,890
不许动
Freeze!

525
00:39:40,540 --> 00:39:43,420
丹尼  我们得走了
Danny! We have to go!

526
00:39:54,060 --> 00:39:55,630
跪下  快
Get on your knees, now!

527
00:39:56,050 --> 00:39:58,160
跪下  手举起来
On your knees! Hands in the air!

528
00:40:10,640 --> 00:40:13,100
你那边除了你都死了
Everyone else on your side is dead.

529
00:40:13,690 --> 00:40:15,610
你知道我是谁  我也知道你是谁
You know who I am, I know who you are,

530
00:40:15,610 --> 00:40:17,920
我们闲话少说
so let's skip the wartime banter.

531
00:40:18,320 --> 00:40:21,210
时间我可浪费不起
Time is not something I can afford to waste.

532
00:40:22,780 --> 00:40:26,560
不是为了你  是为了我  我要把眼罩摘掉
Not for your benefit but for mine, I'm taking the blinds off.

533
00:40:27,200 --> 00:40:29,600
可别咬我  老朋友
Try not to bite, old friend.

534
00:40:29,890 --> 00:40:31,550
那样有失尊严
It's undignified.

535
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:38,190
亚历山德拉
Alexandra.

536
00:40:39,540 --> 00:40:40,660
棍叟
Stick.

537
00:40:41,470 --> 00:40:43,550
我们要说的可太多了
We have so much to talk about.

538
00:40:51,030 --> 00:40:54,840
-有必要吗  -标准流程而已  不是针对你
- Are these necessary? - Standard protocol. Nothing personal.

539
00:40:55,740 --> 00:40:56,830
约翰·雷蒙德
John Raymond,

540
00:40:56,830 --> 00:41:00,300
我们在你办公室或者家里发现的那具尸体
the body we found in your office slash apartment.

541
00:41:00,590 --> 00:41:03,770
马尔科姆·杜卡斯  你的朋友在大厅尽头受审
Malcolm Ducasse, your friend being interrogated down the hall.

542
00:41:04,160 --> 00:41:05,520
还有杰西卡
And Jessica...

543
00:41:06,130 --> 00:41:07,590
-我不知道这是怎么回事  -琼斯
- Look, I don't know what-- - ...Jones.

544
00:41:09,150 --> 00:41:10,240
真的吗
Really?

545
00:41:10,270 --> 00:41:14,330
你对于我来说一直都是个大麻烦  你知道吗
You have been a huge pain in my ass all day, you know that?

546
00:41:14,330 --> 00:41:16,440
-我会因为什么被起诉吗  -现在还不会
- Am I being charged with something? - Not yet.

547
00:41:16,440 --> 00:41:19,520
但你可能打断了全城范围内的调查
But you might have interrupted a city-wide investigation.

548
00:41:19,560 --> 00:41:21,560
你从我的犯罪现场偷了证据
You stole evidence from my crime scene.

549
00:41:21,560 --> 00:41:22,440
我不知道你在说什么
I don't know what you're talking about.

550
00:41:22,440 --> 00:41:24,650
你还害得我的一条线索被杀
And you got my one lead killed.

551
00:41:26,070 --> 00:41:29,050
-我是想帮他  -但你没帮上
- I was trying to help him. - But you didn't.

552
00:41:30,820 --> 00:41:32,890
-他家人很担心  -是吗
- His family was worried. - Yeah?

553
00:41:33,210 --> 00:41:36,820
那现在他们得担心葬礼安排了
Well, now all they have to worry about are funeral arrangements.

554
00:41:38,260 --> 00:41:40,370
你的办公室现在是犯罪现场
Your office is currently a crime scene,

555
00:41:40,370 --> 00:41:42,400
但我需要你配合
but I need your cooperation.

556
00:41:42,480 --> 00:41:45,670
-我是嫌犯吗  -刑事破坏
- Am I a suspect? - Criminal mischief...

557
00:41:46,060 --> 00:41:48,650
毁坏证据  轻微偷盗
tampering with evidence, petty larceny--

558
00:41:48,650 --> 00:41:50,850
-我是谋杀嫌犯吗  -不是
- Am I a murder suspect? - No.

559
00:41:50,850 --> 00:41:52,880
但你应该知道谁杀了他
But I think you know who killed him.

560
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:56,800
-是啊  他开枪自杀的  -那你在追谁
- Yeah. He shot himself. - Then who were you chasing?

561
00:41:58,590 --> 00:41:59,910
警官  除非你有理由拘留我
Officer, unless you have a reason to hold me--

562
00:41:59,910 --> 00:42:03,160
别跟我扯"警官"那些没用的  你看见什么了
Don't give me that "officer" bullshit. What did you see?

563
00:42:11,590 --> 00:42:14,120
我知道你觉得自己在做本职工作
Look, I know that you think you're just doing your job,

564
00:42:14,290 --> 00:42:18,190
但我告诉你  这个案子不一般
but I'm telling you, this case isn't normal.

565
00:42:18,350 --> 00:42:21,060
你搅进了奇怪的事情里
You are walking into some weird-ass shit.

566
00:42:21,280 --> 00:42:23,500
杰西卡·琼斯  别说了
Jessica Jones, stop talking.

567
00:42:23,590 --> 00:42:25,160
结束了
Hi, this is over.

568
00:42:26,130 --> 00:42:27,270
你是谁
Who the hell are you?

569
00:42:27,270 --> 00:42:29,770
我叫马修·默多克  是你的律师
My name is Matthew Murdock. I'm your attorney.

